(footprint "AIRCOIL_5MM"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Air-core coil wound from 0.8mm enamelled wire on a 5mm mandrel: 5 turns = 82nH (input BPF), 7 turns = 150nH (x5 multiplier tanks). Legs 8-10mm so the coil can be slid/stretched during alignment. INCLUDES a copper-pour keepout on both layers: a ground plane under an air coil kills its Q and shifts its inductance. Place coupled pairs about one coil diameter apart - the spacing IS the coupling (k~0.03); route nothing between them.")
